{"1996090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vapor World: Over The Mind", "steam_appid": 1996090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Countless dreams, bled into a vast world. A sea, deep within the mind. <strong>It is called the Vapor World.</strong> Sorrow becomes the beast, guilt the prison, and some live out an eternity inside their nightmares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the unfathomable abyss of this dream, you awaken as the Last Awakened One. Wake the Sleeping Ones, and this world will collapse at last, freeing you to return to reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost and corrupted by the Id, the boy is you. In the deepest of dreams, everything you lost awaits. Wake every last Sleeping One, and face the truth buried below.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract the Embers, Defeat the Projections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect an enemy's strike, and force a Crack Break. Extract the ember the defenseless projection lays bare, with the power of the Id.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Mind Shaped by Sorrow and Regret</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layers of the dream are joined as one seamless, borderless world. Reclaim your lost powers with the embers the projections leave behind. Then venture into the deepest reaches of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recall Forgotten Skills, Grow Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every useful tool brought back, more becomes possible at the workbench. Read the scattered records to recall forgotten skills, and let the symbols the Sleeping Ones left behind take root in you, to project them in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Countless dreams, bled into a vast world. A sea, deep within the mind. <strong>It is called the Vapor World.</strong> Sorrow becomes the beast, guilt the prison, and some live out an eternity inside their nightmares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the unfathomable abyss of this dream, you awaken as the Last Awakened One. Wake the Sleeping Ones, and this world will collapse at last, freeing you to return to reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost and corrupted by the Id, the boy is you. In the deepest of dreams, everything you lost awaits. Wake every last Sleeping One, and face the truth buried below.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/916f9a4c543c7194a9cd117c74791ce6.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract the Embers, Defeat the Projections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect an enemy's strike, and force a Crack Break. Extract the ember the defenseless projection lays bare, with the power of the Id.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/e1250e66072ed62f5c9967887184e5e8.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Mind Shaped by Sorrow and Regret</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layers of the dream are joined as one seamless, borderless world. Reclaim your lost powers with the embers the projections leave behind. Then venture into the deepest reaches of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.poster.avif?t=1787549229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.webm?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/d867b9f7de365180c2aff4cbcdbada33.mp4?t=1787549229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recall Forgotten Skills, Grow Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every useful tool brought back, more becomes possible at the workbench. Read the scattered records to recall forgotten skills, and let the symbols the Sleeping Ones left behind take root in you, to project them in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lost in darkness, a boy drawn into a twisted dream, no way out. Vapor World: Over The Mind is a narrative-driven souls-like platformer focused on deflection combat. Descend into a shattered mind seeking lost memories. Face the dark, beautiful world born of sorrow and regret.", "supported_languages": "English, Kor